    "description": {
      "content": "The Bubble Workflow API lets external systems trigger backend workflows\ndefined in a Bubble app. Each workflow is exposed at a path of the form\n`/api/1.1/wf/{workflow_name}` and may be invoked via POST or GET. Authentication\nrequirements are configurable per workflow (none, user/admin, or admin only).\nWorkflows can return structured JSON, plain text, custom content, or HTTP\nredirects on success/error.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Bubble Support",
